{
  "focus": {
    "start": 0,
    "end": 382,
    "text": "c. The applicant may not continue to use a previous name after a material name change unless the name change documentation specifically permits the applicant to continue using that name (see 8 FAM 403.1-6 regarding “known as” names).\n\n(3) You must clear the applicant's pending name even though the name change is not final and even if the passport is not being issued at this time."
  },
